  "solution": {
    "text": "\\(\\begin{aligned} & \\left|\\begin{array}{ccc}1 & 2 & 3 \\\\ -4 & 3 & 6 \\\\ 2 & -7 & 9\\end{array}\\right|=1\\left|\\begin{array}{cc}3 & 6 \\\\ -7 & 9\\end{array}\\right|-2\\left|\\begin{array}{cc}-4 & 6 \\\\ 2 & 9\\end{array}\\right|+3 \\\\ & \\left|\\begin{array}{cc}-4 & 3 \\\\ 2 & -7\\end{array}\\right| \\\\ & \\end{aligned}\\)\n\\(\\begin{aligned}\n& =1(3 \\times 9-6(-7))-2(-4 \\times 9-2 \\times 6)+3 \\\\\n& ((-4)(-7)-3 \\times 2) \\\\\n& =(27+42)-2(-36-12)+3(28-6)=231\n\\end{aligned}\\)",
